Bundled service credentials
music_assistant/helpers/app_secrets.json

The release builds of Music Assistant (the wheel and the container image)
include this file. It holds the API keys and other credentials for the services
Music Assistant integrates with, so these integrations work out of the box. The
source code, including the source distribution, does not include it.

This file is NOT covered by the Apache License 2.0. You may redistribute it
unmodified, for use with Music Assistant only. Do not extract the credentials
or use them in any other application; register your own with the service
instead.

Builds without this file can supply their own credentials, see
music_assistant/helpers/app_vars.py.
